{"study_accession":"PRJNA390991","secondary_study_accession":"SRP109668","title":"RNA-seq reveals abundant circRNA, lncRNA and mRNA in blood exosomes of patients with hepatocellular carcinoma","description":"Exosomes are small membrane vesicles of endocytic origin secreted by most cells, and contain a wealthy cargo of protein and RNA species that can modulate recipient cells’ behaviors and may be used as biomarkers for diagnosis of human diseases. They have been found in blood and are valuable sources for biomarkers due to selective cargo loading and resemblance to their parental cells. The goal of this study is to identify circRNA, lncRNA and mRNA profiles in human blood by high-throughput RNA sequencing (RNA-seq). 1-4 ml plasma or serum were used to extract exosomal RNAs by exoRNeasy Serum/Plasma Maxi kit (Qiagen). The exosomal RNAs were further treated with DNAse I and subjected to ribosome minus low-input RNAseq library preparation. The libraries were sequenced by Illumina Hiseq platform. Overall design: Human blood exosomal RNAs were generated by deep sequencing using Illumina Hiseq.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":21,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN07255989","study_accession":"PRJNA390991","blood_class":"plasma_serum_cfrna","class_from":"sample","title":"HCC21","description":"HCC21","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM2674658","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2018-02-26","attributes":[["source_name","Blood exosome"],["disease","hepatocellular carcinoma"],["tissue","Blood"],["tissue compartment","exosome"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR5712536","experiment_accession":"SRX2932970","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2000","read_count":16615627,"base_count":4954888500,"first_public":"2018-02-26","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 2000 sequencing: GSM2674658: HCC21 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMN07255990","study_accession":"PRJNA390991","blood_class":"plasma_